  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/973e655920fef2f634.jpg\"><img alt=\"עובד כבול לתג עובד ולטלפון סלולארי\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/973e655920fef2f634.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כבלים של זהב</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיַּעֲבִדוּ מִצְרַיִם אֶת בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</span></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div>הֵם אוֹמְרִים שֶׁהוּא,</div><div>נוֹעַד לִפְתֹּחַ דְּלָתוֹת.</div><div>שֶׁמְּשַׁמֵּשׁ לְוִדּוּא,</div><div>בְּמַעֲבַר מַחְלָקוֹת.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: large;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎫</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>שֶׁרַק בְּעֶזְרָתוֹ,</div><div>תִּזְכֶּה לַהֲטָבוֹת.</div><div>וְאַךְ בְאֶמְצָעוּתוֹ,</div><div>תִּשְׂבַּע אֲרוּחוֹת.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🍱</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>מוּגָן מִכָּל שִׁבּוּשׁ,</div><div>נִכְנָס לְכָל כִּיס.</div><div>מִתְקַבֵּל ב-'סִיבּוּס',</div><div>אֲפִלּוּ בְּ-'תֵּן-בִּיס'.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦘</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>אֶת כַּרְטִיסְךָ, עוֹבֵד,</div><div>לְעוֹלָם אַל תְּאַבֵּד.</div><div>נְצֹר לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד,</div><div>אֶת הַתָּג - אֶת הָעֵד.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🏷️</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>שֶׁפַּעַם נִתְלָה בִּכְפִיָּה,</div><div>עַל עֲבָדִים מֻכֵּי רָזוֹן.</div><div>וְהַיּוֹם, מִתְנוֹסֵס בְּגַאֲוָה,</div><div>נֶעֱנָד לַצַּוָּארִים, מֵרָצוֹן.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🎀</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>הֵידָד! אַתָּה שַׁיָּךְ,</div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div>לְחֶבְרָה אוֹ לְאִרְגּוּן.</div><div>כִּי אַתָּה רוֹצֶה - מֻכְרָח,</div><div>לְהֵאָסֵר בַּאׇזִיק עִגּוּן.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⛓️</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>הוֹי מַשְׁאָב תָּם,</div><div>כְּשֶׁהַמְּנַהֵל אוֹתְךָ יַעֲרִיךְ.</div><div>תִּזְכֶּה בְּטֵלֵפוֹן חָכָם,</div><div>עוֹד כֶּבֶל מַאֲרִיךְ...</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦮</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span></div><div><br /></div><div>כִּי הַיּוֹם זֶה כָּךְ,</div><div>תְּקוּפָה שֶׁל קִדְמָה.</div><div>בּוֹ שׁוּק עֲבָדִים, הָפַךְ,</div><div>לִירִיד תַּעֲסוּקָה.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧰</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>תָּמִיד תִּהְיֶה זָמִין,</div><div>בַּיּוֹם וְגַם בָּעֶרֶב.</div><div>כִּי אָז לְךָ נַזְמִין,</div><div>לוֹגוֹ - עַל חֻלְצָה וְגֶרֶב.</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🉑</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div>זֶהוּ ג'וֹבּ חֲלוֹמוֹת,</div><div>כִּי גַּם בִּשְׁנַת הַלֵּילוֹת,</div><div>תּוּכַל לַחֲלֹם עַל יְשִׁיבוֹת,</div><div>מַחְלַקְתִּיּוֹת אוֹ צִוְתִּיּוֹת...</div></span></span></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Rubik; font-size: 20pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">😴</span></div></span></span></div></blockquote>"
}
